config ZMK_VELVET_DRAGON_DISPLAY
    bool "Velvet horizontal dragon-girl display"
    depends on ZMK_DISPLAY
    depends on SHIELD_VELVET_LEFT || SHIELD_VELVET_RIGHT
    help
      Native 160x68 monochrome artwork and status on both nice!view displays.
      Uses the existing display hardware and ZMK idle blanking. Select the
      custom status screen and disable NICE_VIEW_WIDGET_STATUS when enabled.
